  "summary": "Silan's 200 mm silicon carbide power-device fab in Xiamen's Haicang District, mainly for SiC MOSFETs. Agreed with the city and district in May 2024 at CNY 12 billion over two phases, its buildings were topped out in February 2025 and tools began arriving in June 2025. The Phase 1 line was connected on 4 January 2026 and is to ramp toward 420,000 wafers a year through 2028; both phases are planned at 720,000 wafers a year.",
